  "brain_first": "“解决原问题，再让人物情绪落地；不要最后一分钟再开新 坑。”",
  "sort_order": 1068,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2763
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "第二段需要解决主要问题并结束故事。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2764
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2765
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Closure：让故事主要矛盾得到合理回应。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2766
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “解决原问题，再让人物情绪落地；不要最后一分钟再开新",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2767
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "坑。”",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2768
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 高考续写看重与原文和给定首句的一致性。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2769
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2770
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 回到原文最核心的问题。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2771
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 让人物通过已有资源/帮助完成关键行动。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2772
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 写结果。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2773
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 写简短情绪/关系变化。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2774
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 若自然，可呼应原文物品/细节；不强行升华。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2775
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2776
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2777
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2778
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· lost item → find/return + reaction",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2779
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· conflict → action/apology + repaired relation",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2780
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· challenge → attempt + result + reflection",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2781
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 主问题已解决，读者不会问“然后呢？”",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2782
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 不会写哲理结尾时，停在具体画面/人物反应就可以。",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2783
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2784
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "She checked the bag once more and found everything inside. Her tense face softened into a smile.",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2785
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Thank you,” she said, holding the bag close as the train pulled in.",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2786
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2787
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 强行“From that day on I learned...”每篇一样。",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2788
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 解决后又突然出现新事故。",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2789
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2790
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 原问题解决了吗？",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2791
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 结尾与人物情绪一致吗？",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2792
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2793
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜C-E 情绪线错｜C-S 故事情节逻辑错。",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2794
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2795
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 第二段：解决问题，情绪落地，别再开新坑。",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2796
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2798
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 第二段最重要任务？",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2799
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 结尾突然出现新冲突合适吗？",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2800
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 强行“From that day on...”每篇都用？",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2801
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 首尾呼应可呼应什么？",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2802
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 结尾应该继续扩写很久吗？",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2803
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 解决原文主要问题并收束。；2. 通常不合适。；3. 避免模板化。；4. 原问题/物件/关系/情绪。；5. 问",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2804
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题解决后及时收住。",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2805
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— CW5 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“CW5”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 104,
      "sourceIndex": 2806
    }
